// Command & Conquer: Generals Zero Hour -- Arabic game text
//
// Plain UTF-8. One entry is a label line, a quoted string, and END.
// Lines starting with // are comments. Escapes: \n \t \" \\
//
// Translated from the English original (EnglishZH.big, generals.csf) into Modern Standard
// Arabic, with colloquial touches where a joke needs them. The GLA is "جيش التحرير العالمي".
// Text is stored in logical order with base letters; the engine shapes and lays it out right
// to left (render2dsentence.cpp). Hotkeys follow "الاسم (&K)". Multiplayer map names stay in
// English. Checked with scripts/language/translate_kit.py. See languages/README.md before editing.

